  <data key="d7">{"finding": "1D_CNN on sers_data_3_classes: After 9 trials varying num_conv_layers (2-4), filters (64-256), learning_rate (0.0001-0.0005), dropout (0.3-0.5), the best HO accuracy was 0.4061 (CV 0.7446), with CV-HO gap &gt;0.33 in all runs. The persistent inversion\u2014CV &gt;0.74, HO &lt;0.41\u2014confirms the root cause is not hyperparameter-tunable; data leakage or evaluation flaw is strongly suspected. Optuna sweep failed with internal tool error '_missing_from_sweep', so systematic optimization remains untested but unlikely to overcome the structural gap. No configuration approached the stale 0.6259 peak.", "category": "dead_end", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN", "_data_source": "sers_data_3_classes", "_manifest_name": "sers_data_3_classes", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "1D_CNN"}}</data>
  <data key="d8">[-0.058955000000000014, 0.08163037165166975, 0.0044166764797810565, 1.5639984609818463, 0.07088648320884706]</data>
</edge>
