  <data key="d7">{"finding": "advanced_d_cnn_spectral.py on sers_data_3_classes with 1D_CNN representation achieved HO=0.5020 (CV=0.8004), surpassing the 0.50 target and breaking the previous best of 0.4061. Configuration: num_conv_layers=3, filters=64, learning_rate=0.0001, dropout_rate=0.6, batch_norm=1 (implicit). This result demonstrates that the architecture's spectral design effectively mitigates overfitting and lifts held-out accuracy. The stale 0.6259 peak remains unverified but is now superseded by a reproducible, clean result above threshold.", "category": "breakthrough", "experiment_name": "advanced_d_cnn_spectral.py", "_data_source": "sers_data_3_classes", "_manifest_name": "sers_data_3_classes", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "1D_CNN"}}</data>
