  <data key="d7">{"finding": "Cycle 11 on refined_d_cnn_optimized.py / sers_data_3_classes: 5 trials with varied num_conv_layers (2-4), filters (32-64), lr (1e-4 to 5e-4), dropout (0.45-0.5). All HO accuracies 0.2846\u20130.3925, all CV 0.7467\u20130.8518. CV\u2013HO gap remains 0.40\u20130.57 \u2014 terminal overfitting confirmed across all configs. O1 falsified: num_conv_layers=3 did not reduce inversion below 0.1963. O2 blocked (analyze_best_vs_worst_trials needs 10+ results). The root cause \u2014 unaddressed data leakage in the train/val/test split \u2014 makes all 1D_CNN tuning futile. Until the split is audited and leakage eliminated, no hyperparameter change will close the gap.", "category": "overfitting", "experiment_name": "refined_d_cnn_optimized.py", "_data_source": "sers_data_3_classes", "_manifest_name": "sers_data_3_classes", "_dataset_params": {"n_fft": 512, "hop_length": 64, "gaf_image_size": 48, "video_num_segments": 8, "video_gaf_image_size": 24, "representation_type": "1D_CNN"}}</data>
